# Agreement Entry into Force Date

This scope computes the date the agreement enters into force based on the latest notification date.
```catala
declaration scope AgreementEntryIntoForce:
  input latest_notification_date content date
  output entry_into_force_date content date
```
The agreement enters into force 14 days after the date of receipt of the date of the latest notification.
```catala
scope AgreementEntryIntoForce:
  date round down
  definition entry_into_force_date equals latest_notification_date + 14 day
```